  "description": "Ana Abiyedh Rouge is a warm, radiant fragrance that blends sweet amber with airy florals and a distinctive saffron signature. The scent feels luminous, slightly sweet, and elegant, with a smooth balance between warmth and freshness. The opening introduces saffron and delicate jasmine, creating a bright, slightly spicy floral accord. The heart develops into warm amber and sweet notes that add depth, richness, and a soft glowing character. The base settles into musk and woody accords, leaving a clean, long-lasting, and slightly airy trail. Ana Abiyedh Rouge is perfect for those who enjoy sweet amber fragrances with a saffron-floral brightness and a smooth musky finish.",
